1
00:00:00,080 --> 00:00:01,980
Hi, we are Team Baseline.

2
00:00:02,080 --> 00:00:05,327
We chose astronaut health: on Mars, help is far away.

3
00:00:05,427 --> 00:00:09,627
Meet CrewPulse: a health check that knows each astronaut's own normal.

4
00:00:09,727 --> 00:00:13,430
A daily check-in becomes a body map in green, amber or red.

5
00:00:13,530 --> 00:00:20,227
On real NASA Inspiration4 blood data, seventy-two percent of personal shifts passed a normal range check.

6
00:00:20,327 --> 00:00:22,862
With signal delays, it says what to do first.

7
00:00:22,962 --> 00:00:26,424
Next, every crew member carries their own normal to Mars.

